that is NOT included here and keeps its own licence:
  NSD and Unbound (NLnet Labs, BSD-3-Clause)   - patched by patches/nsd, patches/unbound
  liboqs (Open Quantum Safe, MIT)              - ML-DSA-44
  ldns (NLnet Labs, BSD-3-Clause)              - used by abhed-signzone
  OpenSSL (Apache-2.0), libevent (BSD-3-Clause), expat (MIT)
go/vendor/ contains github.com/miekg/dns (BSD-3-Clause) and golang.org/x modules
(BSD-3-Clause) with their licence files.

Specifications implemented are IETF Internet-Drafts (work in progress). Merkle Tree
Ladder mode is the work of Verisign Labs; Verisign has filed IPR statements on the
MTL drafts in the IETF datatracker. Read them before any use beyond research.
